<title>FRANCE: TABLE-WORMS REPORTS HIGHER 1997 H1 SALES.</title>
<headline>TABLE-WORMS REPORTS HIGHER 1997 H1 SALES.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>     Turnover  (pro forma)	    19,660  vs 18,715</p>
<p>	- includes holding		    23  vs	7</p>
<p>	- industrial			 3,441  vs  3,395</p>
<p>	- paper			     15,246  vs 14,426</p>
<p>	- maritime			     950  vs    887</p>
<p>NOTE - Worms et Cie gave its sales in the</p>
<p>official bulletin BALO.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
